@DaricTrading.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5175
@UserId = 10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Create a buy order
POST {{DaricTrading.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orders/buy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{UserId}}",
  "weightGrams": 1.250,
  "unitPrice": 3500000,
  "fee": 5000,
  "tags": ["پس‌انداز_بلندمدت"]
}

### Read wallet balance
GET {{DaricTrading.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/wallets/{{UserId}}/balance
Accept: application/json

### Search settled orders
GET {{DaricTrading.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orders?userId={{UserId}}&orderType=Buy
Accept: application/json
